  "description": "The Legion L40 is the perfect BMX-style bike for riders 5'0\" to 5'6\" and comes in two color options. Today's the day to up your BMX game — order a Mongoose bike to make that happen.\nHi-Ten steel frame and mid BB shell.\nDrivetrain features 175 mm 3-piece tubular chromoly hollow spindle cranks with a 25T steel chainring and mid sealed bearing bottom bracket.\n20\" x 2.3\" tires mounted on aluminum single wall 36H rims with 3/8\" in axle front hub and 9T cog sealed bearing cassette rear hub.\nHi-Ten steel handlebar and fork, 50 mm stem, standard 1-1/8\" headset, and aluminum U-brake and brake levers.\n20.5\" top tube length. Suggested rider height is 5'0\" – 5'6\".",
